codex
The root cause is now evidenced: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<current-pid>/exe`, while Lean 4.22 queries the latter. I added a narrow temporary compatibility shim that redirects only that exact self-executable readlink; Lean now reports the locked commit. I’m rerunning the unchanged trusted checker under that compatibility environment.
