+```
+
+It is not a duplicate or weakened theorem.
+
+### Axiom accounting
+
+The exact Lean result is:
+
+```text
+'Proof.final' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
+```
+
+There is no `sorryAx`. `propext` and `Quot.sound` are the standard Lean
