+|---|---|---|---|
+| 7–9 | `rule-106b748797b8869ec5735d1b277b53f4922be8d92cbb3ba87f899c23d0041e14` | `DEFINITION` | Expands the named `vowelCodes` macro to the exact ten-code `IntSeq`. |
